# Required review

House style is mandatory. Do not treat it as optional.

Before you finish a task, PR, or say work is done:

1. Read `.cursor/rules/` and self-review with `.cursor/skills/code-review/`.
2. Run `pnpm check`. Fix failures. Do not skip.
3. Do not merge or hand off with Must-fix rule violations (`any`, `!`, inline styles, hardcoded copy, default exports, `@/` imports).
